<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines' Mabuhay sets IPO price at 1.90 pesos.</title>
<headline>Philippines' Mabuhay sets IPO price at 1.90 pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippines' Mabuhay Vinyl Corp said on Friday it had set the price of its initial public offering at 1.90 peso per share.</p>
<p>The chemical company is offering 223,187,000 shares to the public between January 13 and January 24.</p>
<p>The tentative listing date is on February 5.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
